    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An endless forest. A magical delivery. A shortcut Ozric will never forget.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the enchanted chaos of <strong><i>Ozric</i></strong>, a rogue-lite action adventure where every run is a challenge, and every upgrade matters. You are <strong>Ozric</strong>, a humble courier mage with a magical package and a tight deadline. When you take a shortcut through the mysterious<strong>\u00a0Forest</strong>, the path begins to shift, twist, and fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against waves of twisted forest creatures in fast-paced combat. Collect powerful upgrades, experiment with wild magic, and push deeper into the ever-changing forest. With every defeat, you grow stronger\u2014and so does the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Rogue-lite action combat with fluid movement and reactive enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 Procedurally generated upgrades and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 A growing arsenal of magical abilities, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Replayability with escalating difficulty and waves of new monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 A whimsical tale of magic, mischief, and a very important delivery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest remembers every step you take. Will Ozric find his way out, or become part of the woods forever?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An endless forest. A magical delivery. A shortcut Ozric will never forget.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the enchanted chaos of <strong><i>Ozric</i></strong>, a rogue-lite action adventure where every run is a challenge, and every upgrade matters. You are <strong>Ozric</strong>, a humble courier mage with a magical package and a tight deadline. When you take a shortcut through the mysterious<strong>\u00a0Forest</strong>, the path begins to shift, twist, and fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against waves of twisted forest creatures in fast-paced combat. Collect powerful upgrades, experiment with wild magic, and push deeper into the ever-changing forest. With every defeat, you grow stronger\u2014and so does the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Rogue-lite action combat with fluid movement and reactive enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 Procedurally generated upgrades and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 A growing arsenal of magical abilities, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Replayability with escalating difficulty and waves of new monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 A whimsical tale of magic, mischief, and a very important delivery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest remembers every step you take. Will Ozric find his way out, or become part of the woods forever?</p>",
